{#- The card a link to /play opens into (Facebook, Messages, texts). The
    café's front at sunrise behind everything, the name on a teal fade at
    the left, and across the bottom the steel pass with plates up under
    the heat lamp and the bell: "order up", drawn. The game's own sprites
    (partials/game/sprites.njk), so it looks like the game. Red only on the
    Play button, as in the game (game/README.md). No people.

    Words follow STYLE.md: no exclamation marks, no emoji, no URL (the
    preview prints the address under the picture). Facebook trims the edges
    a little on a phone, so nothing that matters is within 40px of them. -#}
{% include "partials/game/sprites.njk" %}
<div class="canvas ou-share">
    <svg class="ous-scene" viewBox="0 0 360 210" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin slice" aria-hidden="true">
        {% include "partials/game/storefront.njk" %}
    </svg>
    <div class="ous-fade"></div>
    <div class="ous-lamp"></div>

    <div class="ous-copy">
        <p class="ous-kicker">A little game from</p>
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero">{% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}</div>
        <p class="ous-title">Order Up</p>
        <p class="ous-line">A week on the flat-top at {{ site.address.street }}</p>
        <div class="ous-row">
            <span class="ous-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3l12 7-12 7z"/></svg>Play on your phone</span>
            <span class="ous-levels">Easy · Regular · Rush</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ous-pass" role="img" aria-label="Plates up on the pass: a burger, eggs and bacon, the daily special, a coffee, and the bell">
        <div class="ous-shelf"></div>
        <div class="ous-food">
            <svg class="ous-plate" viewBox="0 0 140 110" aria-hidden="true">
                <use href="#s-plate" width="140" height="140" transform="translate(0 70) scale(1 .3)"/>
                <use href="#s-special" x="20" y="8" width="100" height="100"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="ous-plate" viewBox="0 0 140 110" aria-hidden="true">
                <use href="#s-plate" width="140" height="140" transform="translate(0 70) scale(1 .3)"/>
                <use href="#s-bacon" x="54" y="32" width="76" height="76"/>
                <use href="#s-egg" x="6" y="30" width="80" height="80"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="ous-plate ous-plate--big" viewBox="0 0 140 110" aria-hidden="true">
                <use href="#s-plate" width="140" height="140" transform="translate(0 70) scale(1 .3)"/>
                <use href="#s-burger" x="16" y="-4" width="108" height="108"/>
                <path class="ous-steam" d="M52 14c-6-6 6-10 0-16M70 10c-6-6 6-10 0-16M88 14c-6-6 6-10 0-16"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="ous-cup" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#s-cup"/></svg>
            <svg class="ous-bell" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#s-bell"/></svg>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
